result or substitute a different argument.\\\",\\\"basis\\\":\\\"The task requires expanding every nontrivial step and prohibits hiding algebra theorems in calculations or definitions. The supplied proof-draft asserts the implication ‘finitely generated torsion-free R-module of rank one; equivalently it is free rank-one’ without proof. Although this is a standard theorem, no permitted M/E source has been provided or probed, and proving the needed fractional-ideal principal property would be additional work beyond a verifiable local correction on the present record. This is a suspected substantive gap, not a claim that the theorem is false.\\\",\\\"partial_progress\\\":\\\"Read the three frozen task documents and the NL0 stage, format, self-containment, authoring, logical-rules, Audit A and external-theorem Yui rules. Confirmed the exact target is for arbitrary admissible M, all fields K of prime characteristic p, 0 ≤ λ < p, including λ=0 and p=2. Checked the divided-power/matrix-unit portion of the candidate route; the unresolved point identified above is the arbitrary-lattice rank-one module argument needed before reduction.\\\"}\"}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"search_mathlib","description":"在固定 mathlib 的 Lean 源码中搜索正则表达式，返回至多 100 行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_mathlib","description":"读取固定 mathlib 中一个 Mathlib/...lean 文件的指定行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start_line":{"type":"integer"},"line_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start_line","line_count"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_task_input","description":"Read an explicitly frozen task document by ID; no other local files are accessible.","parameters":{"type":"objec